      "preview": "אַרְגְּוָן: púrpura, fio de púrpura e possível variante textual.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְגְּוָן</span></big>  <strong>s.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>púrpura (</strong>de forma aramaica; cf. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:7\" href=\"/Daniel.5.7\">Dn 5:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:16\" href=\"/Daniel.5.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:29\" href=\"/Daniel.5.29\">29</a>; talvez erro textual<strong>)</strong> = <em>fio de púrpura</em> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 2:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.2.6\">2 Ch 2:6</a>; (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּרְמִיל וּתְכֵלֶת</span>); cf. <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 2:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.2.13\">2:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 3:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.3.14\">3:14</a>; sob <a data-ref=\"BDB, אַרְגָּמָן\" href=\"/BDB,_אַרְגָּמָן\", dir=\"rtl\">אַרְגָּמָן</a>.",
      "translation_status": "TRADUCAO_INTEGRAL",
      "collation_status": "COLACIONADO",
      "validation_status": "VALIDADO_ESTATICAMENTE",
      "audit_status": "BLOQUEADA",
      "publication_status": "PUBLICADO_ORIGEM",
      "integration_status": "NAO_INTEGRADO",
      "source_blob_sha": "19ae5e1ae8cf4975f2d5c507bd2ce504a99293b1",
