      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרַוְנָה</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio masculino: Araúna</strong>, jebuseu—<span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:20\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.20\">2 S 24:20</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:21\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:22\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:23\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.23\">23</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (mas leia-se <span dir=\"rtl\">עֶבֶד אֲדֹוֹנִי</span>; cf. We e Dr), v. <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:23\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:24\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.24\">24</a>; quetive <span dir=\"rtl\">גֹּרֶן האורנה</span> v. <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.16\">16</a> (Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">הָאֲרַוְנָה</span>) com artigo, mas cf. Dr; quetive <span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳ ארניה</span> v. <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:18\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.18\">18</a> (qerê <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרַוְנָה</span>); = <span dir=\"rtl\">אָרְנָן</span> (veja-se o verbete) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 21:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.21.15\">1 Ch 21:15 f</a>; 𝔊 em Samuel e Crônicas: Ὀρνα.",
