      "preview": "אֶ֫רֶז: cedro; árvore, madeira de construção e material ritual de purificação, com usos figurados.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֶ֫רֶז</span></big>  <strong>s.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:23\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.23\">Ez 17:23</a></sup> <strong>cedro</strong>;—<strong>feminino</strong> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:22\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.22\">Ez 17:22</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ הָרָמָה</span>, mas 𝔊 e Co propõem eliminar <span dir=\"rtl\">הרמה</span>;—<strong>(</strong>árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">أَرْزٌ</span> <em>pinheiro</em>, etc.; etiópico አርዝ, siríaco <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܰܪܙܳܐ</span> <strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> no absoluto <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:4\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.4\">Lv 14:4</a> + 19 vezes, <span dir=\"rtl\">אָ֑רֶז</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 40:17\" href=\"/Job.40.17\">Jb 40:17</a> + 6 vezes; plural: <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרָזִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.9\">Is 9:9</a> + 35 vezes; construto: <span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְזֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 2:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.2.13\">Is 2:13</a> + 5 vezes; com sufixo: <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרָזֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 22:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.22.7\">Je 22:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 11:1\" href=\"/Zechariah.11.1\">Zc 11:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרָזָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.24\">Is 37:24</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:23\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.23\">2 K 19:23</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>cedro</em>, (<em>a</em>) como árvore <em>em crescimento</em> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 24:6\" href=\"/Numbers.24.6\">Nu 24:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 148:9\" href=\"/Psalms.148.9\">ψ 148:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.19\">Is 41:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.14\">44:14</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.8\">Ez 31:8</a>; especialmente crescendo no Líbano <a data-ref=\"I Kings 5:13\" href=\"/I_Kings.5.13\">1 K 5:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:9\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.9\">2 K 14:9</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.18\">2 Ch 25:18</a> (ambos na fábula de Jeoás); frequentemente <span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְזֵי (הַ)לְּבָנוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:15\" href=\"/Judges.9.15\">Ju 9:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 2:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.2.13\">Is 2:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.8\">14:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 29:5\" href=\"/Psalms.29.5\">ψ 29:5</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (figuradamente) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:16\" href=\"/Psalms.104.16\">104:16</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"I Kings 5:20\" href=\"/I_Kings.5.20\">1 K 5:20</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:23\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.23\">2 K 19:23</a> = <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.24\">Is 37:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 92:13\" href=\"/Psalms.92.13\">ψ 92:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 5:15\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.5.15\">Ct 5:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.5\">Ez 27:5</a> (singular coletivo) <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 11:1\" href=\"/Zechariah.11.1\">Zc 11:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 11:2\" href=\"/Zechariah.11.2\">2</a> (figuradamente); <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 1:17\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.1.17\">Ct 1:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 3:7\" href=\"/Ezra.3.7\">Ezr 3:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 22:23\" href=\"/Jeremiah.22.23\">Je 22:23</a> (figuradamente) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.3\">Ez 17:3</a> (figuradamente); (<em>b</em>) especialmente em comparações, indicando poder exterior, imponência e majestade <a data-ref=\"Psalms 80:11\" href=\"/Psalms.80.11\">ψ 80:11</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(א׳ אֵל)</span> cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.3\">Ez 31:3</a> (personificação; mas veja-se Co quanto ao texto), <a data-ref=\"Amos 2:9\" href=\"/Amos.2.9\">Am 2:9</a>; acerca de indivíduos <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 22:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.22.7\">Je 22:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 92:13\" href=\"/Psalms.92.13\">ψ 92:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:22\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.22\">Ez 17:22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:23\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.23\">23</a>; cf. os outros exemplos de uso figurado acima; comparação de retidão e força <a data-ref=\"Job 40:17\" href=\"/Job.40.17\">Jb 40:17</a> (cauda do hipopótamo).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>madeira de cedro</em> para construção, <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲצֵי אֲרָזִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 5:11\" href=\"/II_Samuel.5.11\">2 S 5:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 5:22\" href=\"/I_Kings.5.22\">1 K 5:22</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 5:24\" href=\"/I_Kings.5.24\">24</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:10\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.10\">6:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 9:11\" href=\"/I_Kings.9.11\">9:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 14:1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.14.1\">1 Ch 14:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 22:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.22.4\">22:4</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 2:7\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.2.7\">2 Ch 2:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 3:7\" href=\"/Ezra.3.7\">Ezr 3:7</a>; sem <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵץ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 7:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.7.2\">2 S 7:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 7:7\" href=\"/II_Samuel.7.7\">7</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:9\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.9\">1 K 6:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:15\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:16\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:18\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.18\">18</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:20\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:36\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.36\">36</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:2\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.2\">7:2</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:3\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:7\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:11\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:12\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.12\">12</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 10:27\" href=\"/I_Kings.10.27\">10:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 17:1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.17.1\">1 Ch 17:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 17:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.17.6\">6</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 1:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.1.15\">2 Ch 1:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 2:2\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.2.2\">2:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 9:27\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.9.27\">9:27</a> & <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 8:9\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.8.9\">Ct 8:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.9\">Is 9:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 22:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.22.14\">Je 22:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 22:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.22.15\">15</a> (cf. também <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.14\">Is 44:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 5:20\" href=\"/I_Kings.5.20\">1 K 5:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.5\">Ez 27:5</a> acima).<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>madeira de cedro</em> utilizada em purificações, com <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:4\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.4\">Lv 14:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:6\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:49\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.49\">49</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:51\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.51\">51</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:52\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.52\">52</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 19:6\" href=\"/Numbers.19.6\">Nu 19:6</a> (all P).",
