      "headword": "אָרַךְ",
      "ref": "BDB, אָרַךְ",
      "preview": "אָרַךְ: ser longo, prolongar, adiar; duração do tempo, da vida e de objetos, paciência e demora.",
      "html": "† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">אָרַךְ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אָרֵךְ</span>]</big></big>  <strong>v. ser longo</strong>, quase sempre referido ao tempo <strong>(</strong>acadiano <em>arâku</em>, COT<sup>Gloss</sup>; aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרַךְ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܶܪܰܟ</span><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong> perfeito: <span dir=\"rtl\">אָֽרְכוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:8\" href=\"/Genesis.26.8\">Gn 26:8</a>; imperfeito: <span dir=\"rtl\">יַאַרְכוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 12:22\" href=\"/Ezekiel.12.22\">Ez 12:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 12:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.12.3\">3</a> fem. pl.: <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתֶּאֱרַכְנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.5\">Ez 31:5</a> (suprimam-se B e Co)—<em>ser longo</em>, sujeito <span dir=\"rtl\">הַיָּמִים</span> (isto é, decorreu muito tempo <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:8\" href=\"/Genesis.26.8\">Gn 26:8</a> (J); cf. acadiano <em>urriku ûmî</em>, <em>os dias se prolongaram</em>, Tábua da Criação<sup>a</sup>, veja-se COT <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:1\" href=\"/Genesis.1.1\">Gn 1:1</a>); acerca do cumprimento retardado de uma profecia <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 12:22\" href=\"/Ezekiel.12.22\">Ez 12:22</a>; sujeito <span dir=\"rtl\">פֹּארֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.5\">Ez 31:5</a> (mas cf. acima).<br><strong>Hifil</strong> perfeito: <span dir=\"rtl\">הֶאֱרִיךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.11\">Pr 19:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְהַאֲרַכְתָּ֫</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:7\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.7\">Dt 22:7</a> etc.; imperfeito: <span dir=\"rtl\">יַאֲרִיךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 17:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.17.20\">Dt 17:20</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">יַאֲרִיכוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 25:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.25.15\">Dt 25:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יַאֲרִכוּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 20:12\" href=\"/Exodus.20.12\">Ex 20:12</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 5:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.5.16\">Dt 5:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 6:2\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.6.2\">6:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּאֲרִיכֻן</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:26\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.26\">Dt 4:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 30:18\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.30.18\">30:18</a> etc.; imperativo fem. sing.: <span dir=\"rtl\">הַאֲרִיכִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 54:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.54.2\">Is 54:2</a>; infinitivo construto: <span dir=\"rtl\">הַאֲרִיךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 9:19\" href=\"/Numbers.9.19\">Nu 9:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 9:22\" href=\"/Numbers.9.22\">22</a>; particípio: <span dir=\"rtl\">מַאֲרִיךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:15\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.15\">Ec 7:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 8:12\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.8.12\">8:12</a>;—<strong>1.</strong>  Transitivo, <em>prolongar</em>: (<em>a</em>) com objeto <span dir=\"rtl\">יָמִים</span> (isto é, viver muito tempo) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:26\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.26\">Dt 4:26</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:40\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.40\">40</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 5:27\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.5.27\">5:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 11:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.11.9\">11:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 17:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.17.20\">17:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:7\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.7\">22:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 30:18\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.30.18\">30:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:47\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.47\">32:47</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 24:31\" href=\"/Joshua.24.31\">Jos 24:31</a> = <a data-ref=\"Judges 2:7\" href=\"/Judges.2.7\">Ju 2:7</a> (com <span dir=\"rtl\">אַחֲרֵי</span> = <em>sobreviver</em>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.16\">Pr 28:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 53:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.53.10\">Is 53:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 8:13\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.8.13\">Ec 8:13</a>; também, em uso tardio, sem <span dir=\"rtl\">ימים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:15\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.15\">Ec 7:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 8:12\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.8.12\">8:12</a>; (<em>b</em>) <em>idem</em> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 3:14\" href=\"/I_Kings.3.14\">1 K 3:14</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>, sujeito <span dir=\"rtl\">וְהַאֲרַכְתִּי אֶת־יָמֶיךָ</span> <em>prolongarei os teus dias</em>; (<em>c</em>) <em>adiar</em> a ira <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 48:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.48.9\">Is 48:9</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.11\">Pr 19:11</a> (isto é, mostrar-se tardio em irar-se); veja-se também <a data-ref=\"Job 6:11\" href=\"/Job.6.11\">Jb 6:11</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">אַאֲרִיךְ נַפְשִׁי</span>, isto é, ser paciente; (<em>d</em>) literalmente (mas em contexto figurado), <em>alongar</em> sulcos (com <span dir=\"rtl\">ל</span>) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 129:3\" href=\"/Psalms.129.3\">ψ 129:3</a>; as cordas de uma tenda <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 54:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.54.2\">Is 54:2</a>; a língua <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.4\">57:4</a> (estendê-la em sinal de escárnio). <strong>2.</strong>  Intransitivo, <em>tornar-se longo, prolongar-se, continuar por muito tempo</em> (isto é, <em>manifestar</em> extensão ou continuidade), sujeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יָמִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 20:12\" href=\"/Exodus.20.12\">Ex 20:12</a> = <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 5:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.5.16\">Dt 5:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 6:2\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.6.2\">6:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 25:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.25.15\">25:15</a>; <em>demorar-se por muito tempo</em> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 9:19\" href=\"/Numbers.9.19\">Nu 9:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 9:22\" href=\"/Numbers.9.22\">22</a> (sujeito <span dir=\"rtl\">הֶעָנָן</span>); <em>durar</em> (continuar) <em>muito tempo</em>, sujeito <span dir=\"rtl\">כֵּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.2\">Pr 28:2</a>; <em>ser comprido</em> (literalmente), acerca dos varais da arca <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:8\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.8\">1 K 8:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 5:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.5.9\">2 Ch 5:9</a>.",
