      "html": "† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">אָרֹךְ</span>]</big>  <strong>adj. longo</strong>—somente fem. sing. absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרֻכָּה</span>;—<br><strong>a.</strong>  Quanto ao tempo, <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמִּלְחָמָה א׳</span> <em>guerra prolongada</em> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:1\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.1\">2 S 3:1</a>; acerca do exílio <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 29:28\" href=\"/Jeremiah.29.28\">Je 29:28</a>;<br><strong>b.</strong>  figuradamente, acerca da sabedoria de Deus <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ מֵאֶרֶץ מִדָּהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 11:9\" href=\"/Job.11.9\">Jb 11:9</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">רְחָבָה מִנִּי־יָם</span>).",
